{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TMElive國際音樂大賞今日（22日）在啟德主場館舉行，一眾韓星出席下午舉行的紅地氈儀式，出席韓星包括Aespa、Babymonster、82MAJOR、奔赴少年CIIU、Daniel Seavey、KiiiKiii、NexT1DE、NOWZ、ALLDAY PROJECT • ALPHA DRIVE ONE、Hearts2Hearts、TAEYONG、YEONJUN、MC張天賦、RIIZE、SUPER JUNIOR、TOMORROW X TOGETHER。當中Aespa在紅地氈最搶鏡，尤其以Karina最性感，一身造型突顯其驕人身材，四人更以國語同現場觀眾打招呼。</p><figure><img alt=\"TMElive國際音樂大賞今日（22日）在啟德主場館舉行。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861206586232832280346.jpeg/Gw0hhUVj_5Wg7QnrDALD7UGNivm6wJq0mxBpa6EQaWs\"/><figcaption>TMElive國際音樂大賞今日（22日）在啟德主場館舉行。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aespa性感現身紅地氈。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861049441914880437692.jpeg/0mKntgLzzzcR_YwFrR1WK5ekmFBIW9NWLNlyTRrZck0\"/><figcaption>Aespa性感現身紅地氈。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861057583583232648590.jpeg/U60aHAiA2XjD7XPFKRHP3qm2eZlsIGmlyJbWrPKW1qw\"/><figcaption>Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861055574380544561834.jpeg/JMCFNa8jE-jGtKz9lPX3r-5TQHyNuPXz6eiqxdPoqsU\"/><figcaption>Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861204455395328430829.jpeg/bEkYrQYV2R3ieUOm07bSA1wTOQOQ3CBT4TC1HtswtR4\"/><figcaption>Ningning仙氣滿瀉！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Karina谷胸最搶鏡！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861051581140992674210.jpeg/mGp703FD5f7BixZBk0cJx_Ks33wvBV6ILxbMUxUWzFM\"/><figcaption>Karina谷胸最搶鏡！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Karina谷胸最搶鏡！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260822/1167861031821643776864103.jpeg/BH6Hps0TCzQwnvrSEJea9eBSgAwH03cUZbdH_VO3R_0\"/><figcaption>Karina谷胸最搶鏡！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Karina谷胸最搶鏡！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://